Package: nvidia-legacy-304xx-driver
Architecture: amd64
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 nvidia-legacy-304xx-driver-libs (= ${binary:Version}),
 nvidia-legacy-304xx-driver-bin (= ${binary:Version}),
 nvidia-legacy-304xx-kernel-support (= ${binary:Version}),
 nvidia-legacy-304xx-kernel-${kernel:Flavour} | nvidia-legacy-304xx-kernel-dkms,
Recommends:
 libgl1-nvidia-legacy-304xx-glx,
 xorg-server-legacy-nvidia-23,
Provides: nvidia-legacy-driver
Conflicts: nvidia-driver, nvidia-legacy-driver
Replaces: nvidia-legacy-driver
Description: NVIDIA legacy 304.137 driver metapackage (GeForce 6/7 series (NV4x, G7x))
 The 304.137 driver from the NVIDIA 304xx legacy series, repackaged as a
 reproducible build for focal.
 .
 Supported hardware: GeForce 6/7 series (NV4x, G7x).
 .
 UPSTREAM STATUS: Upstream EOL 2017-09. Kernel module forward-ported to Linux ~7.2 (import flydiscohuebr/nvidia-304 + adapt 390xx patches). X driver needs the private xorg-server-legacy-nvidia-23 (video ABI 23). See docs/legacy-feasibility.md.

 .
 SECURITY WARNING: this driver series receives NO security updates from NVIDIA
 and has publicly known, unpatched vulnerabilities. Install it only on isolated
 or offline systems, or where the hardware leaves no supported alternative.
 debconf shows this warning again at install time.
 .
 This package is BEST-EFFORT for ubuntu2004: the shipped X server ABI
 (24) is newer than what this driver officially supports
 (23). IgnoreABI is enabled automatically. Test before relying on it.

Package: nvidia-legacy-304xx-driver-libs
Architecture: amd64 i386
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Provides: nvidia-legacy-304xx-driver-libs-nonglvnd
Description: NVIDIA legacy 304.137 driver — core runtime libraries
 Shared libraries used by the NVIDIA 304.137 driver: libnvidia-glcore,
 libnvidia-tls, libnvidia-eglcore and friends. Install the :i386 variant
 alongside for 32-bit OpenGL applications.

Package: nvidia-legacy-304xx-driver-bin
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: NVIDIA legacy 304.137 driver — utilities
 nvidia-smi, nvidia-settings' backend, nvidia-xconfig, nvidia-debugdump and
 the nvidia-persistenced daemon for the 304.137 driver.

Package: libgl1-nvidia-legacy-304xx-glx
Architecture: amd64 i386
Multi-Arch: same
Section: non-free/libs
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, nvidia-legacy-304xx-driver-libs (= ${binary:Version})
Provides: libgl1-nvidia-glx
Description: NVIDIA legacy 304.137 driver — libGL / GLX
 The NVIDIA implementation of libGL and the GLX extension for the 304.137
 driver, wired through glvnd where the distro provides it.


